<title>USA: Alico Q2 shr climbs to $1.17.</title>
<headline>Alico Q2 shr climbs to $1.17.</headline>
<dateline>LABELLE, Fla 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.17		    $0.20</p>
<p> Net			  8,300		    1,400</p>
<p> Oper revs		 15,500		   11,800</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.23		    $0.29</p>
<p> Net			  8,600		    2,000</p>
<p> Oper revs		 20,000		   19,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Alico Inc.</p>
<p>1997 Q2 ended February 28, while 1996 Q2 ended February 29.</p>
<p>The large increase in net income was primarily due to the sale of 21,700 acres of land, in Hendry County, Florida to the South Florida Water Management District. The sale generated a pre-tax gain of $11.3 million and is included in the fiscal 1997 second quarter results.</p>
</text>
